description: Next.js App Router and Tailwind CSS v4 architecture rules for VinFast EV Platform
globs: ["src/**/*.tsx", "src/**/*.ts", "src/**/*.css"]
alwaysApply: true
---

# Architecture Rules

- Use React Server Components by default; add `"use client";` only when using state, hooks, or event listeners.
- Use Tailwind CSS v4 utility classes.
- Dashboard background is `#1f1f1f`. Card backgrounds are `#262626` / `#2a2a2a` with borders `#333333`.
- Types are defined in `src/types/dashboard.ts` and re-exported in `src/types/index.ts`.
- Mock datasets are placed in `src/data/mockDashboardData.ts` and re-exported in `src/data/index.ts`.
